<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>AMI on 我的博客</title><link>https://wangqian306.github.io/tags/ami/</link><description>Recent content in AMI on 我的博客</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 13 Sep 2018 18:36:55 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://wangqian306.github.io/tags/ami/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>对AMI BIOS固件解锁隐藏选项（解锁CSM）</title><link>https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Sep 2018 18:36:55 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;本文接上篇&lt;a class="link" href="http://blog.mxslly.com/archives/63.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;神舟战神z7-pro强刷BIOS教程(AMI BIOS)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;替换开机图片完毕后（或者替换失败也没关系，不影响使用），我们继续修改BIOS，解锁BIOS里面的高级选项，我这里要解锁CSM选项&#10;使得BIOS能支持安装Windows7&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;先放上成果：[修改版BIOS固件][5]支持CSM模式蓝天logo&#10;链接：[https://pan.baidu.com/s/1L42A-BEJVttqrxHEUuuUkA][6]&#10;密码：dsyk&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="实测bios关闭uefi磁盘分区表格式mbr能完美安装win7"&gt;实测BIOS关闭UEFI，磁盘分区表格式MBR，能完美安装Win7&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 id="实测bios打开uefi磁盘分区表格式gptbios打开csm模式也能完美安装win7"&gt;实测BIOS打开UEFI，磁盘分区表格式GPT，BIOS打开CSM模式，也能完美安装Win7&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;win7对UEFI启动的支持不完全，在UEFI环境下开机启动的过程中，还是会用传统方式INT 10中断调用显卡驱动，如果BIOS是完全的UEFI环境，那就会开机卡四叶草，如果BIOS有CSM(Compatibility Support Module兼容性支持模块)并打开，那么就会接受win7 INT10调用显卡驱动的方式，从而正常启动。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="1下载修改工具amibcp-v502"&gt;1.下载修改工具[amibcp v5.02]&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;链接: &lt;a class="link" href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1HBAX2bpqmjQY2EdqNFmYOA" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;https://pan.baidu.com/s/1HBAX2bpqmjQY2EdqNFmYOA&lt;/a&gt;&#10;密码: 22cp&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="AMIBCPICON.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="204px" data-flex-grow="85" height="149" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/amibcp.jpg" width="127"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="2运行amibcpexe选择file-open打开要修改的bios固件"&gt;2.运行AMIBCP.exe，选择file-&amp;gt;open打开要修改的BIOS固件&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="AMIBCP打开文件.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="464px" data-flex-grow="193" height="381" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/AMIBCP%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6.jpg" width="737"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="3界面左侧-打开根节点-打开setup节点-选中advanced节点"&gt;3.界面左侧 打开根节点-&amp;gt;打开Setup节点-&amp;gt;选中Advanced节点&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;界面右侧 选中 Show Launch CSM item 选项&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="打开节点.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="463px" data-flex-grow="193" height="429" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9_hu_3a25bb60c7f1793a.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9.jpg 829w" width="829"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="4双击-show-launch-csm-item-选项这一行的accessuse列将default改为user"&gt;4.双击 Show Launch CSM item 选项这一行的Access/Use列，将Default改为USER&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="改为USER.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="463px" data-flex-grow="192" height="594" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%BAUSER.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%BAUSER_hu_2dfe0f8cca698778.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%BAUSER.jpg 1146w" width="1146"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;还是要解释一下，Defalut是默认情况，这个时候选项不一定会出现。但是你改为USER后就一定会出现。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="5点击保存图标保存修改后的固件默认覆盖原文件"&gt;5.点击保存图标，保存修改后的固件（默认覆盖原文件）&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="保存.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="696px" data-flex-grow="290" height="90" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98.jpg" width="261"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="6使用fptw64exe强制刷入固件重启后进入bios查看效果"&gt;6.使用fptw64.exe强制刷入固件，重启后进入BIOS查看效果&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="刷入修改CSM的固件.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="313px" data-flex-grow="130" height="384" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E5%88%B7%E5%85%A5%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9CSM%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6.jpg" width="502"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="7进入主板设置"&gt;7.进入主板设置&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="显示CSM开关.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="463px" data-flex-grow="193" height="429" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BACSM%E5%BC%80%E5%85%B3.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BACSM%E5%BC%80%E5%85%B3_hu_37837ea6b8d54596.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BACSM%E5%BC%80%E5%85%B3.jpg 829w" width="829"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Show Launch CSM Item 选项 打开&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="打开Launch CSM选项.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="463px" data-flex-grow="193" height="429" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80LaunchCSM%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80LaunchCSM%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9_hu_86d8c187c9b91b4e.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80LaunchCSM%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9.jpg 829w" width="829"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;CSM开关 打开&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="最后f4保存重启现在你的bios已经支持uefi下面csm模式启动win7了"&gt;最后F4保存重启，现在你的BIOS已经支持UEFI下面CSM模式启动win7了&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;</description></item><item><title>对AMI BIOS固件修改开机图片（两种方法）</title><link>https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/</link><pubDate>Fri, 07 Sep 2018 18:36:55 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/1633808474.jpg" alt="Featured image of post 对AMI BIOS固件修改开机图片（两种方法）" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;本人笔记本电脑神舟战神z7-pro,蓝天模具型号为P650HP&#10;自带的BIOS功能选项很少，连&lt;a class="link" href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/CSM" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;CSM(Compatibility Support Module兼容性支持模块)&lt;/a&gt;都没有，&#10;所以也就没办法支持(&lt;a class="link" href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/UEFI" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;UEFI引导模式&lt;/a&gt;+&lt;a class="link" href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/GPT" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;GPT分区表格式&lt;/a&gt;)下安装win7&#10;(话说回来，使用Legacy引导模式+&lt;a class="link" href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%B8%BB%E5%BC%95%E5%AF%BC%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;MBR分区表格式&lt;/a&gt;是可以安装win7的，但是我要安装win7+&lt;a class="link" href="https://xubuntu.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;Xubuntu&lt;/a&gt;双系统，所以必须用UEFI引导模式)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="icon集合.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="330px" data-flex-grow="137" height="208" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/2913158569.jpg" width="286"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="1下载最新的bios固件"&gt;1.下载最新的BIOS固件&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="蓝天固件镜像网站"&gt;蓝天固件镜像网站：&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://repo.palkeo.com/clevo-mirror/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;https://repo.palkeo.com/clevo-mirror/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="选择笔记本电脑模具对应的型号打开"&gt;选择笔记本电脑模具对应的型号打开&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="下载固件1.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="555px" data-flex-grow="231" height="344" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3942225142.jpg" width="796"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="根据日期选择最新的bios固件包下载"&gt;根据日期选择最新的BIOS固件包下载&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="下载固件2.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="670px" data-flex-grow="279" height="381" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3064166886.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3064166886_hu_5256e6e0b79f8335.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3064166886.jpg 1064w" width="1064"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="解压固件包"&gt;解压固件包&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="固件压缩包解压.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="485px" data-flex-grow="202" height="784" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3063056455.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3063056455_hu_6e330a3cb02803b0.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3063056455.jpg 1586w" width="1586"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="2使用changelogoexe修改开机图片能忍的跳过"&gt;2.使用ChangeLogo.exe修改开机图片(能忍的跳过)&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="changelogoexe下载"&gt;ChangeLogo.exe下载&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;链接: &lt;a class="link" href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1VdBXh2hU4SSNTcJkiXEUUQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;https://pan.baidu.com/s/1VdBXh2hU4SSNTcJkiXEUUQ&lt;/a&gt; 密码: fszy&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="运行changelogoexe"&gt;运行ChangeLogo.exe&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="打开changelogo.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="643px" data-flex-grow="268" height="325" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3308068115.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3308068115_hu_81e027bc297daad6.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3308068115.jpg 871w" width="871"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="点击btntextload-imagebtntext按钮选择我们解压的p65xhp11固件文件"&gt;点击[btntext]Load Image[/btntext]按钮选择我们解压的P65xHP.11固件文件&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="changelogo打开固件.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="447px" data-flex-grow="186" height="320" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/4167916241.jpg" width="597"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;注意文件类型选ALL Files(&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="打开固件后可以看到有6张图片"&gt;打开固件后可以看到有6张图片&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="changelogo打开固件后.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="537px" data-flex-grow="223" height="322" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3136681123.jpg" width="721"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="点击btntextsave-logobtntext按钮可以将当前选择的图片提取出来"&gt;点击[btntext]Save Logo[/btntext]按钮可以将当前选择的图片提取出来&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;这是提取出来的8张图片&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="提取出来的8张图片.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="1902px" data-flex-grow="792" height="197" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3539449020.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3539449020_hu_6d091029016ff20b.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3539449020.jpg 1562w" width="1562"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;可见这开机图片是有多丑。。。&#10;第一张1.bmp是UEFI模式下开机屏幕正中间的logo图片，大小是640px&lt;em&gt;480px，&#10;第二张2.bmp是Legacy模式下开机屏幕正中间的logo图片，大小是640px&lt;/em&gt;480px，&#10;第三张3.bmp是Intel的Logo，&#10;后面的几张图片是开机屏幕最下面一行的提示文字，不用改&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="使用photoshop打开1bmp和网上找的炫酷六芒星图片"&gt;使用Photoshop打开1.bmp和网上找的炫酷六芒星图片&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="ps打开两张图片.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="481px" data-flex-grow="200" height="687" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/177493081.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/177493081_hu_42eac4e85af273e0.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/177493081.jpg 1378w" width="1378"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;两张图片的图片模式调整为RGB，这样才能编辑&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="调整为RGB.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="435px" data-flex-grow="181" height="342" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/557492129.jpg" width="621"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;将图层解锁，图像宽度设置为原来的宽度/1.3333333333333(相当于压缩了图片宽度，legacy模式开机时会自动把图片拉伸，UEFI模式则不需要此操作)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="ps压缩图片宽度.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="503px" data-flex-grow="209" height="492" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/2056595200.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/2056595200_hu_2cecdde8a532bb36.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/2056595200.jpg 1032w" width="1032"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;将六芒星图层复制到1.bmp图片中&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="复制图层.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="455px" data-flex-grow="189" height="247" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/2633519885.jpg" width="469"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;将背景图层解锁，并且填充为黑色&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="ps最后效果.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="319px" data-flex-grow="133" height="323" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/2754410345.jpg" width="430"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;将图像模式改回索引模式，提示合并图层，点确定&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="合并图层.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="576px" data-flex-grow="240" height="135" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3525865380.jpg" width="324"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;将图片另存为1-uefi1.bmp(2-legacy1.bmp)，位宽默认为8位，文件格式选OS/2&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="另存为bmp.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="283px" data-flex-grow="118" height="718" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/2939116524.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/2939116524_hu_b1dafaa58547f253.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/2939116524.jpg 848w" width="848"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="bmp保存格式选os2.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="250px" data-flex-grow="104" height="336" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/1606985820.jpg" width="350"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="用同样的方法生成2-legacy1bmp将图片宽度拉伸133333333倍和3bmp像素改为11"&gt;用同样的方法生成2-legacy1.bmp(将图片宽度拉伸1.33333333倍)和3.bmp(像素改为1*1)&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="同样的方法.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="1235px" data-flex-grow="514" height="127" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3947574684.jpg" width="654"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="切回changelogeexe点击browser按钮选择1-uefi1bmp"&gt;切回ChangeLoge.exe，点击browser按钮选择1-uefi1.bmp&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="选择1-1.bmp" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="995px" data-flex-grow="414" height="319" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/1633808474.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/1633808474_hu_36b9a90772b49a7c.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/1633808474.jpg 1323w" width="1323"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="点击replace-logo按钮"&gt;点击Replace Logo按钮&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 id="用同样的方法将1-1bmp替换为第二张开机图片用photoshop将第三张开机图片改为全黑的11像素大小相当于抹除intel商标了用changelogo替换进去可能会碰到签名无效的警告无视即可"&gt;用同样的方法将1-1.bmp替换为第二张开机图片，用Photoshop将第三张开机图片改为全黑的1*1像素大小(相当于抹除Intel商标了)，用changelogo替换进去，可能会碰到签名无效的警告，无视即可&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="替换图片警告.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="538px" data-flex-grow="224" height="324" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/3085047672.jpg" width="727"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="最后导出修改过的固件如果碰到changelogoexe卡死的情况那我就介绍下一个方法"&gt;最后导出修改过的固件，如果碰到changelogo.exe卡死的情况，那我就介绍下一个方法&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h2 id="3使用uefitoolexe替换开机图片"&gt;3